            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://torinmb.github.io/lilfloatycam-updates/changelog/</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Drag any corner of the camera to resize it, and drag the dot on the top edge to change the corner radius
- Reorganized menu with icons, plus an Auto-Check for Updates toggle
- Full screen now covers the Dock and menu bar, and is click-through with a transparent background
- Larger, easier-to-grab border that stays visible while you drag
]]></description>
